Package: TargetSureR
Type: Package
Title: siRNA Off-Target Annotation, Risk Ranking, Tissue and Species Analysis
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Shuai", family = "Ni",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "nishuai@wakerbio.com")
Description: A modular toolkit for evaluating small interfering RNA (siRNA)
    off-target effects. The package annotates candidate off-target sites from
    either siRNA sequences or (transcript, position) inputs, enriches the
    result with curated gene lists and tissue expression, and provides three
    analytical modules: risk ranking against a background library, tissue
    safety profiling using Genotype-Tissue Expression (GTEx) data, and
    cross-species conservation scoring for animal model selection. Sequence
    search of seed-mediated off-targets relies on the 'SeedMatchR' package
    (Cazares et al. 2024) <doi:10.1093/bioadv/vbae002>.
